The [[Hero Shield]] is a [[Shield]] obtained by combining a [[Wooden Buckler]] and a [[Whetstone]] using a [[Twine]]. All of these components are available commonly in the shop, but only [[Adventurer]] can normally obtain [[Twine]].

The [[Hero Shield]] is a solid [[shield]] for its size, blocking more damage than even most of the 6-square shields, and sapping more stamina than the easier-to-craft [[Spiked Shield]]. It also significantly buffs adjacent weapons, up to eight of them, with a bonus that scales off of the weapon's damage, making it great with high damage weapons like [[Impractically Large Greatsword]] and its derivatives, but also just great in the early-game in general.

It is worth noting that the percent damage bonus to the weapons provided by [[Hero Shield]] is a persistent effect, multiplying the weapon's damage even as they gain damage in other ways.
